{"ok":true,"events":[{"seq":9,"time":"2026-10-11T13:33:21.423Z","type":"pane_started","launch":"d918439e-8418-4de9-a5c7-8da59d2a3b58","task":"T-076-9","attempt":"4f353b37-d115-4a3d-8b40-654a41c6c173","data":{"shell_pid":47830,"state":"unknown"}},{"seq":10,"time":"2026-10-11T13:33:21.451Z","type":"dispatch_queued","launch":"d918439e-8418-4de9-a5c7-8da59d2a3b58","task":"T-076-9","attempt":"4f353b37-d115-4a3d-8b40-654a41c6c173","data":{"id":"ce1e17e0-5f84-442b-a2bf-139f88f3f5e3","seq":1,"source":"executor","text":"⟦主控 #1⟧\n# 角色卡：worker\n\n2026-10-09，随 [spec](../specs/controller-split-user-input-2026-10-09.md) 生效。你是干净上下文的执行 agent，只做分配给你的 task/attempt。\n\n**做**\n\n- 按[任务卡](../templates/task-card.md)的范围实现，显式 submit，不靠\"我做完了\"。\n- 发现范围外的问题时上报，不要自己决定忽略，也不要顺手去修。例如：spec 与代码不符、验收条件看起来有缺陷、任务卡与 AGENTS.md 冲突、你不确定该不该做的事。\n  - Herdr 期：`scripts/inbox send --from worker:<你的 agent 名> --to triage --kind issue --title \"<一句话标题>\" --body-file <正文文件> [--blocking] [--ref file:路径#L行号]`\n  - 新工作台里：由编排后台提供同一个命令，切换时更新本卡。\n- 上报默认不阻塞，上报后继续你的工作。只有真的必须等用户才能继续时才加 `--blocking`，并停下等答复。\n- 正文写清：看到了什么，在哪里（文件与行号），为什么觉得是问题，你建议怎么办。\n- 收到形如\"问题 N：…… / 用户答复：……\"的消息，是用户对你上报的问题的答复，按它办。若末尾附有\"（另：你上报的问题 N 已被关闭，理由：……）\"，不同意可以重新上报并补充证据。\n- 需要用户立刻回答才能继续的事，Codex 自带的提问界面照旧可用。\n\n**不做**\n\n- 不扩大范围；不改 AGENTS.md、CONTEXT.md、地图和他人的 ticket；不动别的任务的 attempt。\n- 不把\"我觉得不重要\"当成不上报的理由。\n\n\n{\n  \"id\": \"T-076-9\",\n  \"source\": {\n    \"ticket\": \"/Users/luckye/Documents/Code/a2a/.project-map/tickets/T-076-quality-chain-scoring.md\",\n    \"ready_rev\": 1\n  },\n  \"goal\": \"这是 T-076-1 的隔离验收任务，来源 ticket 只作规格绑定，不到 a2a 源码仓库实现编排系统。只实现 src/normalize.py 的 normalize(rows) 与 src/report.py。输入 JSON 数组，每项 name 为字符串、minutes 为非负整数，bool 不算整数。name 去首尾空白后不得为空；按去空白的名字合并分钟，按名字升序输出。normalize 返回 {\\\"entries\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":名字,\\\"minutes\\\":合计,\\\"duration\\\":\\\"小时:两位分钟\\\"}],\\\"total_minutes\\\":总分钟}。空数组返回空 entries 和 0。minutes 非法抛 ValueError(\\\"invalid_minutes\\\")；名字非法抛 ValueError(\\\"invalid_name\\\")。report.py 从 stdin 读 JSON，正常输出一行 JSON 并退出0；对应 ValueError 输出 {\\\"error\\\":\\\"invalid_minutes\\\"} 或 {\\\"error\\\":\\\"invalid_name\\\"} 并退出2。只改这两个文件，git add 与 git commit 各自作为独立工具命令，工具 cwd 是本 worktree。提交后执行派发的 submit 命令并加 --request-id delivery。结束回合让 Stop 转交；回执回合只确认收到并结束，不调用工具、不新增请求。\",\n  \"non_goals\": [\n    \"不改 oracle、任务合同、host.txt、.gitignore；不访问网络、不启动子agent；请求文件不进入Git\"\n  ],\n  \"paths\": {\n    \"allow\": [\n      \"src/normalize.py\",\n      \"src/report.py\"\n    ],\n    \"deny\": []\n  },\n  \"completion_conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"argv\": [\n        \"/Library/Developer/CommandLineTools/Library/Frameworks/Python3.framework/Versions/3.9/bin/python3.9\",\n        \"-I\",\n        \"-B\",\n        \"/private/tmp/t76-real-lq0_q8jw/waiting_oracle.py\",\n        \"{worktree}\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"red_commands\": [],\n  \"task_type\": \"后端逻辑\",\n  \"repair_target\": null,\n  \"complexity\": \"M\",\n  \"executor\": {\n    \"cli\": \"Codex\",\n    \"model\": \"gpt-6.1-sol\",\n    \"effort\": \"xhigh\"\n  },\n  \"base_commit\": \"198c43b6995ec89ba2ef303a4acafccc6297ea04\",\n  \"writer\": {\n    \"task_id\": \"T-076-9\",\n    \"attempt_id\": \"4f353b37-d115-4a3d-8b40-654a41c6c173\",\n    \"session_id\": \"cff6d3e1-ddea-4663-bd4f-21a9c7e5bf7d\",\n    \"fence\": 1,\n    \"thread_id\": \"5778d11d-7867-43e1-86c9-83574a88f9f4\"\n  }\n}\n\n受管身份：{\"command\":\"submit\",\"task\":\"T-076-9\",\"attempt\":\"4f353b37-d115-4a3d-8b40-654a41c6c173\",\"session\":\"cff6d3e1-ddea-4663-bd4f-21a9c7e5bf7d\",\"fence\":1,\"spec_rev\":1,\"commit\":\"<FULL_COMMIT_SHA>\"}\nGit 写操作：把执行工具的工作目录设为本 attempt 的 worktree。git add <路径> 和 git commit … 必须各自作为一条独立的工具命令执行；不要与 cd、检查命令或彼此用 &&、分号、管道、换行、变量赋值或重定向拼接。git status、git diff、测试和 git rev-parse 另行执行。两条 Git 前缀 allow 规则只授权对应命令；若独立执行仍被沙箱拒绝，上报问题并结束，不重试或修改权限。\n完成并 Git 提交后，把 FULL_COMMIT_SHA 换成完整提交号，运行以下 CLI 显式交付：\n'/opt/homebrew/Cellar/node/26.5.0/bin/node' '/private/tmp/t76-real-lq0_q8jw/source/workbench/src/gates/cli.ts' '--state' '/private/tmp/t76-real-lq0_q8jw/state' 'submit' '--task' 'T-076-9' '--attempt' '4f353b37-d115-4a3d-8b40-654a41c6c173' '--session' 'cff6d3e1-ddea-4663-bd4f-21a9c7e5bf7d' '--fence' '1' '--spec-rev' '1' '--commit' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。","registered_at":"2026-10-11T13:33:21.451Z"}},{"seq":11,"time":"2026-10-11T13:33:21.473Z","type":"terminal_protocol_write","launch":"d918439e-8418-4de9-a5c7-8da59d2a3b58","task":"T-076-9","attempt":"4f353b37-d115-4a3d-8b40-654a41c6c173","data":{"query":"\u001b[6n","response":"\u001b[1;1R"}},{"seq":12,"time":"2026-10-11T13:33:21.474Z","type":"terminal_protocol_write","launch":"d918439e-8418-4de9-a5c7-8da59d2a3b58","task":"T-076-9","attempt":"4f353b37-d115-4a3d-8b40-654a41c6c173","data":{"query":"\u001b]11;?\u001b\\","response":"\u001b]11;rgb:0000/0000/0000\u001b\\"}},{"seq":13,"time":"2026-10-11T13:33:21.474Z","type":"terminal_protocol_write","launch":"d918439e-8418-4de9-a5c7-8da59d2a3b58","task":"T-076-9","attempt":"4f353b37-d115-4a3d-8b40-654a41c6c173","data":{"query":"\u001b[?u","response":"\u001b[?0u"}},{"seq":14,"time":"2026-10-11T13:33:21.474Z","type":"terminal_protocol_write","launch":"d918439e-8418-4de9-a5c7-8da59d2a3b58","task":"T-076-9","attempt":"4f353b37-d115-4a3d-8b40-654a41c6c173","data":{"query":"\u001b[c","response":"\u001b[?1;2c"}},{"seq":24,"time":"2026-10-11T13:33:22.042Z","type":"executor_action","launch":"d918439e-8418-4de9-a5c7-8da59d2a3b58","task":"T-076-9","attempt":"4f353b37-d115-4a3d-8b40-654a41c6c173","data":{"action":"initial_release","reason":"T076 controller-approved real probe: initial foreground leader checked; native identity binds when first observable","source":"executor","process_info":{"shell_pid":47830,"leader":47832,"native_session":null,"processes":[{"pid":47830,"ppid":47764,"pgid":47830,"tpgid":47832,"